gure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-11.17.58.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-11.17.58-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3415\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-11.17.58-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-11.17.58-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-11.17.58-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-11.17.58.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3415'>\n\t\t\t\tOne of the &#8220;housing units&#8221; at Arcosanti\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-11.05.06.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-11.05.06-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-11.05.06-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-11.05.06-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-11.05.06-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-11.05.06.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.43.52.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.43.52-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3422\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.43.52-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.43.52-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.43.52-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.43.52.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3422'>\n\t\t\t\tBronze bells for sale (Kathy bought one)\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.44.00.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.44.00-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3421\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.44.00-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.44.00-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.44.00-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.44.00.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3421'>\n\t\t\t\tLots of bells and pottery for sale at Arcosanti\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.57.14.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.57.14-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3420\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.57.14-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.57.14-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.57.14-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-22-10.57.14.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3420'>\n\t\t\t\tOne of the trails at Arcosanti\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>Now, as in all good road trips, we had to stop for lunch after the trip to Arcosanti. \u00a0We went a little further on down the road to <a href=\"http:\/\/rocksprings.cafe\/\" target=\"_blank\">ROCK SPRINGS CAFE<\/a>, known for it&#8217;s good food and especially it&#8217;s GREAT PIES!<\/p>\n<p>After lunch we headed toward home and pulled off the highway to a little place that Barbara remembered that used to sell wine and chocolate. \u00a0As you can see by the pictures, the place didn&#8217;t appear to be in business any longer. \u00a0We looked around the property a bit and then hit the road again.<\/p>\n<p>Steve noted that just up the road a little further was the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.blm.gov\/az\/st\/en\/prog\/blm_special_areas\/natmon\/afria.html\" target=\"_blank\">Agua Fria National Monument\u00a0<\/a>\u00a0 It&#8217;s a good thing that Steve and Cindy have a 4-wheel drive truck to climb the rocky trail, although Cindy was not real hip on doing the off-road exploring. \u00a0It was fun and we got some great picutures although it was overcast and VERY windy!<\/p>\n<p>We&#8217;ll be heading out of here mid-March, so more to come as we travel eastward. \u00a0Stay tuned.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Today we took a short trip down I-17 to &#8220;Arcosanti&#8220;, started in 1970 by architect Paolo Soleri, Arcosanti is an urban laboratory focused on innovative design, community, and environmental accountability. The goal is to actively pursue lean alternatives to urban sprawl based on Paolo Soleri&#8217;s theory of compact city design, Arcology (architecture + ecology). It&#8217;s &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/02\/23\/architecture-meets-ecology-arcology-at-arcosanti\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Architecture Meets Ecology &#8211; Arcology at Arcosanti<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[586,677,264,19546],"tags":[554707296,554707295,24592,554707300,554707297,554707301,554707299,554707298],"class_list":["post-3302","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-food","category-friends","category-learning","category-sightseeing","tag-architecture","tag-arcosanti","tag-arizona","tag-bear","tag-ecology","tag-macaroni","tag-pie","tag-volunteer"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3302","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=3302"}],"version-